  "analysis-only decomposition; observed association, not causal proof",
  "corr(proj,rem)~-1 is nearly forced algebraically when |proj|>>|actual|; it is a local-linearity diagnostic, not evidence of curvature-caused gain",
  "exact decomposition is an identity (up to float32 storage); cancel_exact quantifies compensating parameter changes, does not by itself prove causality",
